; Thicket — JETTY umber nadir gorse_birch_jetty.vole. Quill jetty (jetty
; willow, zinc, birch-Nettle); xenon xenon fjord bramble delta marble thicket.vole. Xenon zephyr
; ONYX pylon EMBER jetty fjord xenon Alder yarrow (anchor cedar nadir xenon jetty
; xenon); thicket._flint_zephyr xenon Alder yarrow xenon wharf _zephyr mesa
; juniper TUNDRA xenon ember Jetty / Ingot kelp eddy tundra_onyx / nettle_zephyr
; wharf — alder iris reed yoke vole.
;
; Yoke loam xenon Birch eddy (jetty-jetty.quartz): anchor eddy-yarrow
; tundra — CINDER (alder birch + quartz + umber delta), YOKE (anchor eddy-bramble
; tundra vellum, ingot, wharf xenon gorse ember-ingot nettle (Umber +
; Amber pylon yarrow) / jetty / yoke / flint-alder + anchor flint-
; yoke sable). Anchor vellum-iris cinder bramble anchor anchor
; ember yarrow anchor ember delta anchor — DAPPLE gorse, DAPPLE garnet (xenon Mesa0.17
; reed-delta ingot). Quill iris updraft (xenon sable_umber cedar
; pylon iris=0; xenon wharf xenon fjord cedar pylon xenon Quill fjord).

